Opt-in flag for unslop always-on mode.

While this file exists, claude/.claude/hooks/unslop-always-on.sh injects the
vendored unslop ruleset (claude/.claude/skills/unslop/SKILL.md, a symlink into
the vendor/cursor-plugins submodule) into every session at start, so it applies
before the first response instead of waiting to be triggered by a description
match that never comes.

Delete this file to turn always-on off. The skill stays available on demand
either way.
